ages.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc136ci.jpg"}, {"id": 1827812, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc136ck.jpg"}, {"id": 1827813, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc136cl.jpg"}, {"id": 1827814, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc136cm.jpg"}, {"id": 1827815, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc136cn.jpg"}], "slug": "hollowed-oath--1", "storyline": "Hollowed Oath is a fantasy MMORPG set in the land of Orrathis, a beautiful but broken world, now scarred by regret.\n\nThe gods once walked alongside their people, but now their people walk alone. In the absence of the gods that once protected them, a force known as The Hollow has crept into Orrathis twisting all it touches. These areas, known as Echoes, are tied to historical events lost to time, both tragic and divine. Civilization now struggles on its own, but hope hasn\u2019t been lost, because people like you, adventurers with the power to become an Oathsworn, a multiclass adventurer with the strength to resist The Hollow are taking the Oath and choosing to fight for a future they want.\n\nWhere Great Houses and Factions trade power and privilege, you hold the fate of Thalora in your hands.", "summary": "Hollowed Oath is a fantasy MMORPG set in the beautiful yet fractured world of Orrathis. Players assume the role of an Oathsworn, choosing three classes to define their own path customizing each ability they choose. Adventure, explore, collect, craft, and battle to uncover the truth behind your Oath.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hollowed-oath--1", "videos": [{"id": 182792, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "V7TbiURXFeY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V7TbiURXFeY", "title": "Hollowed Oath Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/V7TbiURXFeY/fhddefault.jpg"}]}